Pinned native geometry core
===========================

ReShiki includes a geometry-only, statically linked source slice of RDKit
2026.03.6 from https://github.com/rdkit/rdkit at revision
0e0d85f4ca34aeae15dfc0f7cf5503bdb0a8e985. Original source files, copyright
headers, parameter tables and experimental torsion data are preserved in
native/geometry/vendor/rdkit-geometry-2026.03.6.tar.gz. The adjacent manifest
records every file SHA-256. These files retain their upstream BSD-3-Clause
terms; see RDKIT-LICENSE.

This core contains ETKDGv3 distance-geometry embedding, the MMFF94 and
MMFF94s force fields, the Universal Force Field (UFF), their atom typing and
parameter data, and their graph, geometry, optimizer and matching support.
The geometry interface and build integration are original ReShiki code.
The native source slice is not the existing ReShiki Rust chemistry engine.

